    {
      "question": "The Combined Budget and Actual schedule (p9, one 'General All-Purpose Fund' column) includes Nursing Home revenues 2,844,799 and Public buildings - Nursing Home expenditures 2,873,030 and a cash balance of 832,017 / 796,356 that appear nowhere in the basic statements. Should the nursing home activity be captured?",
      "amount": 2844799,
